        <mxCell id="v71" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#E3EEF9'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; lifecycle, indirect trust, locality &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='background:#FDEBDD'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; estimation, policy, detection &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='background:#EEE5F6'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; moderation, evaluation, apps&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#F2F2F2'&gt;&amp;nbsp;shared&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; API and notification stub &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='background:#F7F7F7;color:#999'&gt;&amp;nbsp;deferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; not in iteration 1&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8212; provided interface (ball) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; - - -&amp;gt; required interface (dependency)&lt;br&gt;The S1/S2 boundary is &lt;b&gt;IAssess&lt;/b&gt; (Module 3 &amp;#8594; Module 5) and, inside Module 5, IIndirectEvidence." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
